{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an epic Roguelite adventure wrapped in nostalgic pixel art, where every playthrough offers a fresh and thrilling experience. You play as a brave little slime, summoned by the legendary sorcerer Gandolf Gastor Griffin. Deep beneath his ancient castle\u00a0lies a mysterious dungeon\u2014once dormant, now rumbling with strange quakes and ancient magic. Your curiosity led you to venture deep into the depths to uncover what has awakened.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully random and unique dungeon is generated for each playthrough\u2014filled with secrets, powerful enemies, and lore-rich quests that uncover the lost history of this magical world. As you descend deeper, the foes become fiercer\u2014but don\u2019t worry! You\u2019ll gain access to a wide array of weapons, abilities, and upgrades to help you overcome every challenge.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with friends in multiplayer mode to take down powerful dungeon bosses.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover the secrets that lie beneath Gandolf\u2019s castle?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790590?t=1756547510","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790590?t=1756547510","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790590/597edf7df5d641d5e3b284c1c9f9c2ef8de1259c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756547510","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790590/597edf7df5d641d5e3b284c1c9f9c2ef8de1259c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756547510","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28